# 统一换行符：仓库内文本一律 LF（避免 Windows 检出后整库 diff 噪音）。
# Git 会在提交时把 CRLF 归一化为 LF，检出行为也按下面的规则。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析可能出错。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行符转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
